In the end, my thought is that I'll be using Magicbane by default, but
Excalibur when encountering level-draining monsters. So, my question
for the peanut gallery is: which monsters drain levels, and which
curse at me? I know that vampires and wraiths drain levels, and that
liches curse, but I'm not sure of others. Are there any others
(including named demons, etc.)?

